+        """First KV ring slot reused as sO for this tile.
+
+        After the tile finishes its KV loads, the last R slots in the ring are
+        dead (MMA already consumed them). Those R slots hold the O chunks:
+
+            R = q_stage * epi_n_chunks
+            borrowed range = [end - R, end)  (mod kv_stage)
